Linus,

please pull sound fixes for v2.6.36 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

One regression fix of HD-audio in the previous update, a generic fix
for HDMI setup, AD8994 fixes and a few trivial changes.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Andrea Gelmini (1):
      sound: oss: sh_dac_audio.c removed duplicated #include

Dan Carpenter (1):
      ALSA: sound/usb/format: silence uninitialized variable warnings

Mark Brown (4):
